All material construction recipes, kit entitlements, resource-specific capacities, rate upgrades, payloads, times, power, campaign quantities, and profiles are configurable data. Initial baseline material recipes are below. These replace the old building-placement funds table. Extra buildings do not have a second mandatory funds placement fee. Ordinary part purchase, actual transport fees, vehicle hull orders, fuel purchase and emergency repairs retain their funds rules.

| Extra building or depot module | Metal | Machine Parts | Blueprint |
|---|---:|---:|---|
| Basic ore drill | 100 | 0 | baseline |
| Extra basic smelter | 150 | 0 | baseline |
| Basic fuel-feed pump | 80 | 0 | baseline |
| Basic refinery | 150 | 0 | baseline |
| Basic transport terminal | 120 | 0 | baseline placement; service tier follows campaign |
| Ore bin / Metal bin | 60 | 0 | baseline |
| Slag bin / Fuel-feed bin | 50 | 0 | baseline |
| Parts bin / Supplies bin | 40 | 0 | baseline |
| LiquidFuel tank / Oxidizer tank | 80 | 0 | baseline |
| First or extra shop | 120 | 0 | c04 |
| Basic battery bank (+2000 capacity) | 60 | 0 | baseline |
| Advanced battery bank (+8000 capacity) | 100 | 10 | c03 |
| Solar array | 100 | 20 | c04 |
| Advanced continuous generator | 250 | 60 | c07 |
| Depot single-resource cargo extension | 120 | 20 | depot core unlocked |
| Depot LF tank / Oxidizer tank extension | 150 | 25 | depot core unlocked |
| Depot berth/hangar extension | 200 | 40 | matching fleet-capacity blueprint |
