For minedAfterAccept, batches carry mining event sequence/UT eligibility sublots; stack only with compatible acceptance eligibility or preserve sublots. Do not use a single bool to claim old mined stock was produced after acceptance. Main ore quests may use minedAnyTime with departureAfterAccept=True instead; shipped default is minedAnyTime for c02 onward, so existing legitimately mined ore is useful, but shipments already dispatched before acceptance cannot count. The c03 example uses that default. Unit-test both policies; document the default visibly in contract text.

